# Synora needs NO environment variables to build or run.
#
# AI provider keys are entered by each user in the extension's Settings and stored
# locally in chrome.storage.local. They are never bundled into the build.
#
# NEVER put a real API key in this file or in any file committed to the repo.
#
# This file exists so future optional variables (e.g. a hosted sync endpoint)
# have a documented home. Copy it to .env.local if any are added.
